Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your education loan EMI stops during
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,college.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Does the interest stop too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.22,0:00:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A family takes a big loan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for a degree abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.68,0:00:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They think nothing is due till
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,SBI gives a moratorium,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,a break from EMIs:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,course plus 6 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So they pay nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But the EMI rests,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.70,0:00:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,the interest does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It adds up every month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,When the break ends,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,that interest joins the loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.79,0:00:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A falling rupee also made fees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,costlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.92,0:00:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So the first EMI shocks a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,fresh salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Stretch it to 15 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and you pay more overall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay the interest during college,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.25,0:00:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and the loan stops growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not investment advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.39,0:00:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Send this to your friend taking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.74,0:00:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,a loan to study abroad.
